{{Stub|TotK}}
Rushrooms, like their {{BotW}} incarnation, are purple [[Mushroom]]s typically found growing on rocky cliffs and mountainsides throughout the [[Surface]] of [[Hyrule]]. They can also be found growing within [[Cave]]s, primarily in the [[Mushroom Haven]] located in the [[Hebra Mountains]], and on the sides of [[Sky Island]]s. When [[Cooking|Cooked]] into a [[Meal]], they impart the [[Speed Up]] [[Added Effect]]. [[Weapon]]s with a Rushroom [[Fuse]]d to them gain [[Bouncy]] properties, launching struck [[Enemy|Enemies]] back.

